Package: riversea
Title: Analysis Pipeline for the RIVERSEA Project
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Ismael", "Lajaaiti", , "ismael.lajaaiti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analysis pipeline for the RIVERSEA project, quantifying how dams
    and nutrient loading affect fish food web structure along the
    river-estuary-sea continuum in France. Provides functions to build
    metawebs and local food webs from fish survey data, infer missing fish
    sizes and diets, process AMOBIO and REPHY environmental data, and fit
    structural equation models of environmental drivers on food web structure.
License: GPL (>= 3)
